      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Easton%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Illinois Route 10 cuts through Easton as Main Street, linking the village eastward to Mason City and northward to U.S. highways.",
